==Icelandic==

===Verb===
'''núa''' (+{{dat}}) ([[nýr]]; [[néri]]/[[neri]], [[néru]]/[[neru]], [[núið]])

# to [[rub]], [[massage]]
# to [[wipe]]

====Derived terms====
* [[núa um nasir]]
* [[núa saman höndum]]

====Usage notes====
* One of the four [[w:Ri-verbs|ri-verbs]] in Icelandic; [[gróa]], [[róa]] and [[snúa]].
* Even though that the forms which include an ''[[e]]'' are pronounced as having an ''[[é]]'', the ''[[e]]''-spelling is thought to be correct by the [[w:is:Menntamálaráðuneyti Íslands|Icelandic ministry of education]]. E.g. the [[first person]] [[singular]] [[past tense]] [[indicative]] of the word ''[[núa]]'' ("to rub") which is ''[[neri]]'' ("I rubbed") is preferred over the spellings ''[[néri]]''- even though both are used.

